{"game":"High Roller","source":"custom","apworld":"high_roller.apworld","world_version":null,"groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99},"doc_fr":"Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.\n\nUn réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.</p>\n<p>Un réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.</p>\n"},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full","doc_fr":"Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.\n\n**Full:** s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.\n\n**Minimal:** s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.</p>\n"},{"key":"difficulty","name":"Logic Difficulty","kind":"choice","doc":"The logic difficulty for the slot. Higher difficulty = higher scores expected with less items.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"easy","label":"Easy","id":5},{"value":"medium","label":"Medium","id":6},{"value":"hard","label":"Hard","id":7},{"value":"expert","label":"Expert","id":8},{"value":"mania","label":"Mania","id":9}],"aliases":{},"default":"medium"},{"key":"max_score","name":"Final Check Score","kind":"named_range","doc":"The score of the last check in the slot.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":500,"max":2000,"default":700,"special":{"small":700,"medium":1000,"large":1400,"extreme":2000}},{"key":"goal_score","name":"Goal Score","kind":"named_range","doc":"The score needed to goal the slot.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":500,"max":2000,"default":600,"special":{"light":600,"medium":800,"heavy":1200,"extreme":2000}},{"key":"check_density","name":"Check Density","kind":"range","doc":"The density of locations in the slot. Higher numbers means there are more checks, as checks will be more packed together.\nEx: Check density 1 may only gen 100 checks, but check density 5 might gen with 250 checks given the same max score.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":10,"default":3},{"key":"all_in","name":"All In","kind":"toggle","doc":"Creates one location for every score count, up to your max score.\nWarning: This setting will override Check Density.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false","doc_fr":"Crée un emplacement pour chaque score, jusqu'à votre score maximum.\nWarning: Ce réglage remplacera Check Density."},{"key":"crit_items","name":"Important Items","kind":"choice","doc":"The amount of important items in the slot. More coins, Score Multipliers, and Usables may appear on higher settings.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":1},{"value":"sparse","label":"Sparse","id":2},{"value":"filled","label":"Filled","id":3},{"value":"overloaded","label":"Overloaded","id":4}],"aliases":{},"default":"sparse"},{"key":"crystals","name":"Add Energy Crystals","kind":"range","doc":"Adds energy crystal items to the slot, which are single-use reroll usables. Higher numbers increase the weight of these placed in the item pool after all progression items are added.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":8,"default":2,"doc_fr":"Ajoute des éléments en cristal d'énergie à la fente, qui sont reroll utilisables à usage unique. Des nombres plus élevés augmentent le poids de ceux placés dans le pool d'articles après que tous les éléments de progression sont ajoutés."},{"key":"death_link","name":"Death Link","kind":"toggle","doc":"When you die, everyone who enabled death link dies. Of course, the reverse is true too.\nGetting too many scythes in a line (i.e. getting negative score) sends a deathlink.\nReceiving a deathlink will cause a loss of 1-3 coins, depending on max coin count.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>When you die, everyone who enabled death link dies. Of course, the reverse is true too.\nGetting too many scythes in a line (i.e. getting negative score) sends a deathlink.\nReceiving a deathlink will cause a loss of 1-3 coins, depending on max coin count.</p>\n","default":"false"},{"key":"add_points","name":"Add Points","kind":"toggle","doc":"Adds 'X points' items to the pool, which are points you start each run with.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false","doc_fr":"Ajoute des items \"X points\" à la piscine, qui sont des points avec lesquels vous commencez chaque course."}]},{"name":"Item & Location Options","collapsed":true,"options":[{"key":"local_items","name":"Local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be in their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be in their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"non_local_items","name":"Non-local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be outside their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be outside their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_inventory","name":"Start Inventory","kind":"counter","doc":"Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3} ","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}</p>\n","default":{},"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","min":null,"max":10000,"doc_fr":"Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}</p>\n"},{"key":"start_hints","name":"Start Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these item's locations prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these item's locations prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"C